// Windows resource script for the editor executable.
//
// Resource id 1 is deliberate. Explorer shows the lowest-numbered icon as the
// file's icon, and SDL takes the window icon - the one the taskbar and Alt-Tab
// show - from the executable's first icon as well, so a single entry covers the
// file, the taskbar and any shortcut pointing at it.
1 ICON "icons/gt_gui.ico"
